  "notes": [
    "=== CONFIGURATION GUIDE ===",
    "",
    "1. CREDENTIALS:",
    "   - access_key_id: Get from VSPhone Dashboard → Settings → API",
    "   - secret_access_key: Get from VSPhone Dashboard → Settings → API",
    "",
    "2. INSTANCE:",
    "   - pad_code: VSPhone instance pad code (e.g., APP2509077XXXXX)",
    "   - name: Any name you want (for logs)",
    "",
    "3. CLONES:",
    "   - package: App package name (MUST BE EXACT!)",
    "     Check with: ps -A | grep roblox",
    "   - server_url: Roblox server share URL",
    "",
    "4. DELTA EXECUTOR:",
    "   - enabled: true/false - Enable Delta auto-execute",
    "   - wait_time: Seconds to wait for game load (default: 10)",
    "   - tap_delta_icon: true to auto-tap Delta icon",
    "   - delta_icon_x: Pixels from RIGHT edge (default: 50)",
    "   - delta_icon_y: Pixels from TOP edge (default: 200)",
    "   - close_after_execute: true to close Delta UI after execute",
    "",
    "5. TELEGRAM (Optional):",
    "   - telegram_bot_token: Get from @BotFather",
    "   - telegram_chat_id: Get from @userinfobot",
    "",
    "6. TO ADD MORE CLONES:",
    "   Copy-paste clone object and change:",
    "   - name",
    "   - package",
    "   Keep server_url same if joining same server",
    "",
    "7. TO ADD MORE INSTANCES:",
    "   Copy-paste instance object and change:",
    "   - pad_code",
    "   - name",
    "",
    "8. TO ADD MORE ACCOUNTS:",
    "   Copy-paste account object and change:",
    "   - account_id",
    "   - access_key_id",
    "   - secret_access_key",
    "",
    "=== DELTA ICON POSITION ===",
    "",
    "Default position works for most devices:",
    "- delta_icon_x: 50 (50 pixels from right)",
    "- delta_icon_y: 200 (200 pixels from top)",
    "",
    "If Delta icon in different position:",
    "1. Open Roblox + Delta",
    "2. Note Delta icon position",
    "3. Update coordinates in config",
    "",
    "Common positions:",
    "- Top Right: x=50, y=200 (default)",
    "- Top Left: x=width-50, y=200",
    "- Bottom Right: x=50, y=height-200",
    "",
    "=== TROUBLESHOOTING ===",
    "",
    "1. 'Process not found' but app running:",
    "   → Check package name with: ps -A | grep roblox",
    "   → Update 'package' in config",
    "",
